        </button>

        <div class="sect-label">仓库文章 · 229</div>
        <input class="search" placeholder="搜索 slug…" value="kong-jian" />
        <button class="row">
          <div class="row-title">空间记忆：智能系统缺失的认知底座</div>
          <div class="row-meta"><span class="dot published"></span><span class="row-slug">kong-jian-ji-yi-zhi-neng-xi-tong-que-shi-de-ren-zhi-di-zuo</span></div>
        </button>
        <button class="row">
          <div class="row-title">空间数据的三种尺度</div>
          <div class="row-meta"><span class="dot published"></span><span class="row-slug">kong-jian-shu-ju-de-san-zhong-chi-du</span></div>
        </button>
      </section>

      <!-- ============ EDITOR ============ -->
      <section class="screen" id="s-editor">
        <div class="topbar">
          <button class="icon-btn" title="返回">←</button>
          <span class="brand" style="font-family: var(--sans); letter-spacing: 0.04em; text-transform: none; font-size: 12.5px;">草稿</span>
          <span class="status ok">自动存于 12:07</span>
          <button class="icon-btn" title="更多">⋯</button>
        </div>

        <div class="ed-head">
          <input class="title-input" value="从 Obsidian 到 q-write：长文也该在手机上写" />
          <div class="meta-line">
            <span class="k">SLUG</span>
            <span class="v">cong-obsidian-dao-q-write-chang-wen-ye-gai-zai-shou-ji</span>
            <button class="edit">改</button>
          </div>
          <div class="meta-line">
            <span class="k">TAGS</span>
            <span class="tags"><span class="tag">工具</span><span class="tag">写作</span><span class="tag">PWA</span></span>
            <button class="edit">＋</button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="tabs" role="tablist">
          <button class="tab" role="tab" aria-selected="true" data-pane="write">写作</button>
          <button class="tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-pane="preview">预览</button>
          <span class="sp"></span>
          <span class="wc">1,240 字</span>
        </div>

        <div class="pane on" id="p-write">
          <textarea class="body" spellcheck="false">用 Obsidian 写博客这件事，麻烦的从来不是写，是**发**。

模板要对、frontmatter 要对、图片要先塞进 `public/`、路径要写成站点绝对路径，最后还得等 obsidian-git 把 commit 推上去。手机上想补一段？基本别想。

## 于是有了 q-write

思路很简单：既然 [q-sort](/q-sort/) 已经能把一条 thought 一键怼进仓库，长文没理由做不到。

![](/diagrams/article/01-chat-memory-vs-world-memory.png)

> 关键差别在于长文有生命周期——它要写好几天。

![](uploading:img-3)

正在传的那张图会在原地替换成真实路径，不用等。
</textarea>
